# Types

<!-- l4: declare:Person -->

**1.** In this Act, “Person” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “name”, being a STRING; and

    (b) “age”, being a NUMBER.

<!-- l4: declare:Color -->

**2.** In this Act, “Color” means one of the following—

    (a) “Red”;

    (b) “Green”; or

    (c) “Blue”.

<!-- l4: declare:DataPoint -->

**3.** In this Act, “DataPoint” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “label”, being a STRING; and

    (b) “value”, being a NUMBER.

<!-- l4: declare:TimelineEvent -->

**4.** In this Act, “TimelineEvent” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “year”, being a STRING; and

    (b) “event”, being a STRING.

# Test Data

<!-- l4: decide:alice -->

**5.** Alice means Person where name is Alice and age is 30.

<!-- l4: decide:bob -->

**6.** Bob means Person where name is Bob and age is 17.

# Functions

<!-- l4: decide:is adult -->

**7.** In relation to a Person “p”, is adult means p's age is at least 18.

<!-- l4: decide:age category of -->

**8.** In relation to a Person “p”, age category of means if p's age is at least 65, then Senior; otherwise, if p's age is at least 18, then Adult; otherwise, Minor.

